Juwu
$cards
DECK 2 SPADES

$initial
XIOZOD 1 FACE_HALF
XIOZOD 7 FACE_HALF
XIOZOD 10 FACE_HALF

NAEQUC 2 FACE_ALL
NAEQUC 6 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE NAEQUC XIOZOD
DEST Rank K
MOVE XIOZOD NAEQUC
DEST Suit {CLUBS, SPADES, HEARTS, DIAMONDS}
MOVE_STACK XIOZOD NAEQUC
AND
    DEST Rank 1
    AND
        SRC Suit {CLUBS, DIAMONDS, HEARTS, SPADES}
        DEST Suit {DIAMONDS}
$win
AND
    OR
        PILE ALL XIOZOD Empty
        PILE ALL NAEQUC Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL NAEQUC Empty
        PILE ALL NAEQUC Empty
